'''Mirmo ish Zhifol''', known mononymously as '''Mirmo''' and formerly as '''Prince Mirmo of Qym''', was a [[Qymish people|Qymish]] musician and front man of the rock band [[NAME]]. He was a former member of the [[Qymish royal family]], having renounced his royalty status in {{abbr|2433|2021 (Earth Year Equivalent)}} to pursue a music career, having previously been the [[wikipedia:heir apparent|heir apparent]] to his father, [[Bacha XVIII of Qym|King Bacha XVIII]]. Mirmo was [[Assassination of Mirmo ish Zhifol|assassinated]] during the [[Qymish succession crisis of 2440–2441]]. 

