==Legal issues and controversies==
===Accusations of racism===
In MONTH {{abbr|2439|2026 (Earth Year Equivalent)}}, his brother [[Bacha XIX of Qym|Prince Vuqac]] accused Mirmo of racism towards his girlfriend, [[Mabel Pegan]], and of [[aniphobia]]. 

===Drug use===
In MONTH {{abbr|2439|2026 (Earth Year Equivalent)}}, his brother [[Bacha XIX of Qym|Prince Vuqac]] accused Mirmo of being a drug addict. 

===Sexual misconduct allegations===
In MONTH {{abbr|2439|2026 (Earth Year Equivalent)}}, his brother [[Bacha XIX of Qym|Prince Vuqac]] accused Mirmo of "sleeping with underage fans". 

==Personal life==
Mirmo was the eldest son of [[Bacha XVIII of Qym|King Bacha XVIII]] and [[Queen Qümica of Qym|Queen Qümica]]. He had three siblings, [[Bacha XIX of Qym|Bacha XIX]], [[Princess Tamasna of Qym|Princess Tamasna]] and [[Princess Hyleva of Qym|Princess Hyleva]]. 

